msgstr[1] "FN P90"
msgstr[2] "FN P90"
msgstr[3] "FN P90"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The first in a new genre of guns, termed \"personal defense weapons.\"  FN "
"designed the P90 to use their proprietary 5.7x28mm ammunition.  It is made "
"for firing bursts manageably."
msgstr ""
"Pierwsza z nowej generacji broni, zwanej 'bronią obrony osobistej\". FN "
"opracował P90 do stosowania własnej amunicji 5.7x28mm. Zaprojektowany do "
"kontrolowanego strzelania seriami."

