"You can move more quickly than most, resulting in a 15% speed bonus on sure "
"footing."
msgstr ""
"Poruszasz się szybciej niż inni, wiec masz 15% bonus do szybkości na pewnym "
"podłożu."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Good Hearing"
msgstr "Dobry Słuch"

#. ~ Description for Good Hearing
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your hearing is better than average, and you can hear distant sounds more "
"easily."
msgstr "Masz ponadprzeciętny słuch, i łatwiej ci usłyszeć dalekie odgłosy."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Outdoorsman"
msgstr "Człowiek Lasu"

#. ~ Description for Outdoorsman
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are accustomed to being exposed to the elements.  This decreases morale "
"penalties for being wet."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś przyzwyczajony do bycia wystawionym na żywioły. Obniża kary za bycie "
"mokrym."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Parkour Expert"
msgstr "Ekspert od Parkour"

#. ~ Description for Parkour Expert
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're skilled at clearing obstacles; terrain like railings or counters are "
"as easy for you to move on as solid ground."
msgstr ""
"Jesteś wyszkolony w pokonywaniu przeszkód. Elementy typu poręcze i kontuary "
"są dla ciebie tak łatwe do pokonania jak solidny grunt."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Indefatigable"
